1.0.7

- Mixed question types: multiple choice, listen-and-choose and fill-in,
  alongside flip cards. Auto-graded, so no more grading yourself.
- Combos: 3, 5, 10 in a row and beyond, with Mochi cheering and sounds
  (turn sounds off in Settings).
- Streak flame on the study screen, and a gentle evening reminder.
- Mochi grows: earn star candy, level up, unlock hats, scarves and colours.
- Sticker book: every word you master lights up a sticker.
- 16 badges to collect.
- Weekly recap you can share, and a parent report (Settings > For parents).
